<!-- wp:group {"align":"wide","className":"lgsdn-content-page__hero","layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group alignwide lgsdn-content-page__hero">
	<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"lgsdn-type-lead"} --><p class="lgsdn-type-lead">Share useful knowledge from service design work in local government, so another team can build on what you learned.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->
</div>
<!-- /wp:group -->
<!-- wp:group {"align":"wide","className":"lgsdn-content-page__body","layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group alignwide lgsdn-content-page__body">
	<!-- wp:group {"tagName":"section","className":"lgsdn-content-page__section","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><section class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2} --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">What to share</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {"className":"lgsdn-content-page__section-content","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section-content"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We welcome examples from any local government service and any stage of the work. A contribution does not need to be a finished success story. Honest accounts of constraints, changes of direction and things that did not work are often the most useful.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group -->
	<!-- wp:group {"tagName":"section","className":"lgsdn-content-page__section","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><section class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2} --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">What makes a useful case study</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {"className":"lgsdn-content-page__section-content","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section-content"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Help readers understand the context and reuse what matters. Include:</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><ul class="wp-block-list"><li>the service, challenge and local context</li><li>what the team set out to understand or change</li><li>the methods and activities you used</li><li>what happened and what you learned</li><li>anything another council could reuse</li></ul><!-- /wp:list --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group -->
	<!-- wp:group {"tagName":"section","anchor":"how-to-contribute","className":"lgsdn-content-page__section","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><section id="how-to-contribute" class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2} --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">How to contribute</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {"className":"lgsdn-content-page__section-content","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section-content"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Start a conversation in the network’s Slack workspace. Other members can help you shape the example, identify reusable material and prepare it for the Playbook.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>If you are not already a member, join the network first using your .gov.uk email address.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Or use the expression-of-interest form below to tell us a little about your example. We’ll work through it with you together.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group -->
	<!-- wp:group {"tagName":"section","anchor":"express-interest","className":"lgsdn-content-page__section","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><section id="express-interest" class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2} --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Express your interest</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {"className":"lgsdn-content-page__section-content lgsdn-content-page__form","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group lgsdn-content-page__section-content lgsdn-content-page__form"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Share a few details to get started. You do not need a finished case study; we’ll work through the example with you together. Please do not include personal or confidential information.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Prefer to talk first? Email us at <a href="mailto:contribute@example.org">contribute@example.org</a>.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:shortcode -->[forminator_form id="157"]<!-- /wp:shortcode --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group -->
</div>
